Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.1}

Thought: The series is trend-dominated with moderate ranking stability; a per‑horizon top‑k mean may capture any horizon‑specific model strengths that a global weight misses.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w5"}

