Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

Thought: test a weighted inverse_error combination on the smaller, more stable pool4 to see if trimming reduces variance and improves trend capture.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool4","weights":"inverse_error"}

